      "id": "sol.amc-8-1998-p11.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since Harry has \\(3\\) sisters and \\(5\\) brothers, the family has \\(3\\) girls and \\(6\\) boys. Harriet is one of the girls, so she has \\(2\\) sisters and \\(6\\) brothers.\n\nTherefore, \\(SB=2\\cdot 6=12.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C .",
